[Music]  the cloud sales role has been such an  amazing journey it's just really  exciting what we get to do every day we  talk with all different kinds of  customers the role gives you quite a lot  of freedom  the ultimate goal isn't just revenue but  is actually customer success you know  we're out reaching you're trying to  break new accounts but you're also  dealing with accounts that are already  using Google cloud platform and and G  suite and asking them hey how's it going  you know providing that white glove  treatment to really make sure they have  the best experience with Google my  favorite example of that is Pokemon gun  they were able to go from zero at launch  to being bigger than Twitter in five  days entirely on Google cloud someone  described it to me our role in sales as  being like selling guitars to rock stars  you can really feel like you're a part  of something special we're a provider  that's I mean for the people we're  working directly with our customers that  are using it and getting the most out of  what we provide I think the folks we're  looking for have to be passionate driven  smart we look for people that are  connected that want to work as a team  right this is a team play it's a little  cheesy but the best part of the role is  unquestionably the team being able to  work so closely with Account Executives  who are the best of the best in its  enterprise sales has been a wonderful  learning opportunity and being able to  have front-row seats  to all the product development and  innovation that's going on a Google  cloud is amazing I think the future is  infinite when you think about how  connected this world is becoming we talk  about adding devices into that as well  the big classification around Internet  of Things the potential is infinite and  this platform that we call cloud  actually provides the underpinning of  the foundation on how these companies  will actually deliver those services  we're just now offering it to the public  you know it's the same infrastructure  we've been using internally for you know  since the beginning of Google but  customers are excited about it they're  excited about the products we're talking  to them about the solutions we're  talking about  if you want to fundamentally transform  and change what we're doing and how  technology is consumed in today's  marketplace this is a place to be  [Music]

